1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,584
Who is Chhathi Maiyya?

2
00:00:01,584 --> 00:00:04,723
This story begins with a king's broken heart.

3
00:00:04,723 --> 00:00:05,420
Manu's son

4
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:10,186
King Priyavrata and Queen Malini had no children for years.

5
00:00:10,186 --> 00:00:13,310
Then Sage Kashyapa performed a yagna for them.

6
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,041
The queen gave birth to a son,

7
00:00:16,041 --> 00:00:17,861
but the baby was not breathing.

8
00:00:17,861 --> 00:00:21,090
The king took the son and reached the cremation ground.

9
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:27,362
The grief was so immense that he was ready to give up his own life.

10
00:00:27,362 --> 00:00:28,059
Just then,

11
00:00:28,059 --> 00:00:30,430
a divine light flashed in the sky.

12
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:33,126
The Brahma Vaivarta Purana tells us,

13
00:00:33,126 --> 00:00:36,002
a goddess descended there... I am Shashti,

14
00:00:36,002 --> 00:00:37,920
Brahma's mind-born daughter.

15
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:39,843
I protect every child.

16
00:00:39,843 --> 00:00:42,189
She was the sixth part of nature,

17
00:00:42,189 --> 00:00:43,610
hence named Shashti.

18
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:48,586
The goddess took the child in her lap and the child cried,

19
00:00:48,586 --> 00:00:49,500
becoming alive.

20
00:00:50,310 --> 00:00:51,449
The goddess said,

21
00:00:51,449 --> 00:00:53,458
Worship me and teach everyone.

22
00:00:53,458 --> 00:00:55,870
The king worshipped Goddess Shashti.

23
00:00:57,250 --> 00:00:59,728
Today, during Chhath, along with the Sun,

24
00:00:59,728 --> 00:01:02,146
this very Goddess Shashti is worshipped,

25
00:01:02,146 --> 00:01:04,020
for the protection of children.

26
00:01:04,140 --> 00:01:06,715
Chhath also falls on the Shashti tithi.

27
00:01:06,715 --> 00:01:08,101
In people's parlance,

28
00:01:08,101 --> 00:01:11,006
that very Goddess Shashti is Chhathi Maiyya.

29
00:01:11,006 --> 00:01:11,930
Pay attention,

30
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:14,752
Goddess Shashti is a part of nature itself,

31
00:01:14,752 --> 00:01:17,402
meaning the one who protects our children,

32
00:01:17,402 --> 00:01:18,600
is nature. And see,

33
00:01:19,260 --> 00:01:20,774
Chhath is not in temples,

34
00:01:20,774 --> 00:01:22,289
it is done by riverbanks,

35
00:01:22,289 --> 00:01:23,500
in front of the sun.

36
00:01:24,150 --> 00:01:26,309
Try doing this today. This Chhath,

37
00:01:26,309 --> 00:01:28,532
plant a sapling with your children,

38
00:01:28,532 --> 00:01:30,437
in the name of Chhathi Maiyya.

39
00:01:30,437 --> 00:01:31,580
In the next story,

40
00:01:31,700 --> 00:01:34,138
why is the Sun worshipped during Chhath?

41
00:01:34,138 --> 00:01:35,356
If you already know,

42
00:01:35,356 --> 00:01:36,880
write it in the comments.

